-opacity opacity-50\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"min-h-[calc(100vh-4rem)] flex flex-col justify-between bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0a0e18] text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100\"><main class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 px-6 py-8 sm:py-10\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] px-3.5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\" href=\"/maps\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left h-3.5 w-3.5 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg><span>Kembali ke Peta Nasional</span></a><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] px-3.5 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shadow-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">Edisi 2025.1</span><span>•</span><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span></span><span class=\"font-medium text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">Data Terintegrasi BPS &amp; SKI</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-rose-500/25 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-help h-3.5 w-3.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>DOKUMENTASI &amp; METODOLOGI</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl\">Pertanyaan Umum (FAQ) &amp; Metodologi StuntWatch</h1><p class=\"mt-2.5 max-w-3xl text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Panduan teknis, metodologi pemodelan risiko stunting terintegrasi, dan arsitektur data nasional untuk transparansi pengawasan kesehatan publik.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg></div><div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">38 Provinsi &amp; 514 Kab/Kota</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Cakupan penuh kode wilayah BPS seluruh Indonesia termasuk pemekaran Papua.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-5 w-5\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">SHAP Factor Decomposition</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Kuantifikasi faktor pendorong risiko (+) dan faktor pelindung (-) secara transparan.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">WCAG AA Accessible</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Mendukung navigasi keyboard penuh, pembaca layar, serta mode Terang dan Gelap.</p></div></div></div></div><section aria-label=\"Pencarian dan Filter Topik FAQ\" class=\"mb-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] p-5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200\">Pencarian &amp; Filter Topik</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400\">6 Topik Utama Tersedia</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search pointer-events-none absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Cari pertanyaan, parameter determinan, atau topik metodologi...\" aria-label=\"Cari pertanyaan, parameter determinan, atau topik metodologi\" class=\"h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0d121d] pl-10 pr-9 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 placeholder:text-slate-400 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\" value=\"\"/></div><div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter topik cepat\" class=\"mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-transparent bg-teal-600 dark:bg-[#14b8a6] font-semibold text-white dark:text-slate-950 shadow-sm\">Semua Topik</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-teal-500/50\">1. Indeks Risiko StuntWatch (0–100)</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-teal-500/50\">2. Cara Membaca Grafik SHAP</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-teal-500/50\">3. 12 Indikator Determinan</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-teal-500/50\">4. Arsitektur Data &amp; Integrasi API</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-teal-500/50\">5. Aktual SSGI vs Prediksi Proxy</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-xl border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-teal-500/50\">6. Validasi &amp; Etika Data</button></div></section><section aria-label=\"Daftar Pertanyaan Umum dan Metodologi\" class=\"space-y-3.5\"><article id=\"faq-1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232]/50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400\">1</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg\">Apa itu Indeks Risiko Stunting StuntWatch (0–100)?</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Skala Komposit 0–100</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-up h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m18 15-6-6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] px-5 pb-5 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-4\"><p>Skor komposit ternormalisasi (0 hingga 100) yang memodelkan kerentanan struktural provinsi atau kabupaten/kota terhadap kejadian stunting balita berdasarkan integrasi data SSGI/SKI dan determinan multisektoral SUSENAS BPS. Skor 0–24 dikategorikan Rendah, 25–49 Sedang, 50–74 Tinggi, dan 75–100 Sangat Tinggi.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 pt-2 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-300\">Rendah</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">Skor: 0 – 24</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Kerentanan terkendali; pertahankan layanan dasar.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300\">Sedang</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">Skor: 25 – 49</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Perlu penguatan intervensi sensitif &amp; WASH.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-orange-500/30 bg-orange-500/10 p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-300\">Tinggi</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">Skor: 50 – 74</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Prioritas intervensi multisektoral terpadu.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-rose-500/35 bg-rose-500/10 p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-rose-900 dark:text-rose-300\">Sangat Tinggi</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white\">Skor: 75 – 100</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Zona kritis percepatan penurunan stunting.</p></div></div></div></article><article id=\"faq-2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232]/50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400\">2</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg\">Bagaimana cara membaca Grafik Kontribusi Faktor (SHAP)?</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">TreeSHAP Decomposition</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></span></button></article><article id=\"faq-3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232]/50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400\">3</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg\">Apa saja 12 indikator determinan yang digunakan dalam model?</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">12 Variabel Multisektoral</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></span></button></article><article id=\"faq-4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232]/50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400\">4</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg\">Bagaimana arsitektur data dan integrasi API StuntWatch bekerja?</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Live REST API + EPSG:4326</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></span></button></article><article id=\"faq-5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232]/50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400\">5</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg\">Mengapa beberapa wilayah memiliki label ⚠️ Prediksi Risiko (Provinsi Proxy)?</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Data Equity &amp; Proxy Transparency</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></span></button></article><article id=\"faq-6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#141926] shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50/70 dark:hover:bg-[#1c2232]/50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-500\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400\">6</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg\">Bagaimana validasi model, akurasi (MAE), dan etika tata kelola data diterapkan?</h2><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-100 dark:bg-[#1c2232] px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">GradientBoosting + Governance</span></div><span class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#1c2232] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></span></button></article></section><section aria-label=\"Bantuan Teknis dan Sekretariat\" class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-teal-200/80 dark:border-teal-500/25 bg-teal-50/60 dark:bg-[#111927] p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-teal-800 dark:text-teal-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Punya pertanyaan spesifik?</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Tim metodologi data dan pengembang epidemiologi kami siap memberikan klarifikasi teknis.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 dark:bg-[#14b8a6] dark:hover:bg-[#29a195] px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white dark:text-slate-950 shadow-sm transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-teal-400\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Hubungi Tim Pengembang &amp; Sekretariat</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></section></main><footer class=\"mt-12 w-full border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0e18] px-6 py-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-teal-700 dark:text-[#4fdbc8]\">StuntWatch</span><span>•</span><span>© 2025 StuntWatch Indonesia. Sistem Pendukung Keputusan Spasial Nasional.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 text-[11px] font-medium\"><a class=\"hover:text-teal-60